<%
  // Privacy policy is public — render without auth wrapper if user not set
  const isAuthenticated = typeof user !== 'undefined' && user;
  const content = `
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="page-head-main">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">
      <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
      Legal
    </div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">How 256 Logistics Compliance Hub collects, stores, and processes personal data under UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="max-width:820px">
  <div class="card-body" style="line-height:1.75;color:#334155">

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">1. Who we are</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 20px">256 Logistics Ltd ("we", "us", "our") is the data controller for the personal data processed through this compliance platform. Registered in England and Wales. Contact: <a href="mailto:director@256logisticsltd.com">director@256logisticsltd.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">2. What data we collect</h2>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px">
      <li>Employee records: full name, date of birth, home address, phone, email, NI number, passport/visa details, salary, contract hours, job title, department.</li>
      <li>Compliance documents: Right-to-Work, driving licences, tachograph cards, training certificates, vehicle documents (MOT, insurance, VOR).</li>
      <li>Operational records: daily walk-around checks, defect reports, driver check-ins, PMI schedules.</li>
      <li>System access logs: login timestamps, audit trail of data mutations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">3. Lawful basis for processing</h2>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px">
      <li><strong>Legal obligation</strong> (Article 6(1)(c)) — compliance with the Operator's Licence conditions, Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency (DVSA) requirements, Right-to-Work checking duties under the Immigration Act.</li>
      <li><strong>Legitimate interests</strong> (Article 6(1)(f)) — maintaining fleet safety records, tachograph compliance, and audit readiness.</li>
      <li><strong>Contract</strong> (Article 6(1)(b)) — employment and contractor agreements.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">4. Data retention</h2>
    <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 20px">
      <thead><tr style="background:#f1f5f9">
        <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Category</th>
        <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Retention period</th>
        <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Basis</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Employment records (active staff)</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Duration of employment + 6 years</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Legal obligation (HMRC, employment law)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Right-to-Work documents</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Duration of employment + 2 years</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Immigration Act 2014</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Tachograph / daily check records</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">1 year (EU/GB Regulation)</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">DVSA Operator compliance</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Defect reports</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">15 months</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">DVSA Guide to Maintaining Roadworthiness</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Audit logs (access/mutation)</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">3 years</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Legitimate interests (audit trail)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">System backups</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">30 days</td><td style="padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0">Operational continuity</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">5. Your rights</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Under UK GDPR you have the right to:</p>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px">
      <li><strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of the personal data we hold about you (Data Subject Access Request).</li>
      <li><strong>Rectification</strong> — ask us to correct inaccurate data.</li>
      <li><strong>Erasure</strong> — request deletion of your personal data where we no longer have a legal obligation to retain it.</li>
      <li><strong>Restriction</strong> — ask us to restrict processing while a dispute is resolved.</li>
      <li><strong>Objection</strong> — object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin:0 0 20px">Submit requests to: <a href="mailto:director@256logisticsltd.com">director@256logisticsltd.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">6. Data security</h2>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px">
      <li>All data is transmitted over HTTPS (TLS 1.2+).</li>
      <li>Passwords are hashed with bcrypt (cost 10).</li>
      <li>Documents are stored on the server filesystem, not publicly accessible — served only to authenticated, authorised users.</li>
      <li>Daily encrypted database backups with 30-day retention.</li>
      <li>Access is role-restricted: not all staff can see all data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">7. Third parties</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 20px">We do not sell or share personal data with third parties for marketing. Hosting is provided by Hostinger — we recommend reviewing <a href="https://www.hostinger.com/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their privacy policy</a>. Where email alerts are configured, mail is sent via the configured SMTP provider.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px">8. Complaints</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0">You have the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO): <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint</a>.</p>

  </div>
  <div class="card-footer" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
    <span style="font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8">Last reviewed: June 2026</span>
    ${isAuthenticated ? '<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/">Back to dashboard</a>' : '<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/login">Sign in</a>'}
  </div>
</div>
`;
%>
<% if (isAuthenticated) { %>
  <%- include('../layouts/main', { body: content }) %>
<% } else { %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Privacy Policy — 256 Logistics</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
  <style>body{padding:24px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}</style>
</head>
<body><%- content %></body>
</html>
<% } %>
